            ["Full bags means we've been busy. Proud of us."] = "male\\bagsFull_5.ogg",
            ["You came back for me, matey. That's worth more than a full cargo hold."] = "male\\lore12997_befriended_1.ogg",
            ["You stay after the food's gone. That's how I know you've come to see me."] = "male\\lore13018_befriended_1.ogg",
            ["You remembered me. I was hoping you would. Shall we sit together a while?"] = "male\\lore14041_befriended_1.ogg",
            ["You want my company? Splendid. Lead on, my friend. I should enjoy hearing what has caught your interest. We may find a small question worth a remarkably long conversation."] = "male\\lore273065_befriended_1.ogg",
            ["Good company doesn't have to fill every silence. I think we're going to get along very well."] = "male\\lore274917_befriended_1.ogg",
            ["A familiar face with enough sense to come back. Yes, yes, I'm pleased. Don't make a ceremony of it."] = "male\\lore4081_befriended_1.ogg",
            ["You ask good questions, and you let me know when I've talked enough. I value both."] = "male\\lore5174_befriended_1.ogg",
            ["You listen to the explanation and stay for the conversation. I like that."] = "male\\lore5175_befriended_1.ogg",
            ["Someone who listens, asks questions, and still comes back. That's a fine friend for an engineer. Shall we see what's out there?"] = "male\\lore5518_befriended_1.ogg",
            ["You heard the tune and stayed for the company. I like that. Come along, my friend. We can make a little noise together."] = "male\\lore5519_befriended_1.ogg",
            ["A new friend! Now that is a proper occasion. I'm pleased you came by."] = "male\\lore5569_befriended_1.ogg",
            ["You listen when I get excited! And you come back for the next idea! What a splendid friend!"] = "male\\lore6169_befriended_1.ogg",
            ["You keep coming back. That matters rather more than a magnificent entrance."] = "male\\lore6569_befriended_1.ogg",
            ["A friend. Yes, I'd like that very much. Gelbin will do when it's just the two of us."] = "male\\lore7937_befriended_1.ogg",
            ["You listen to the explanation, and remember the person giving it. I appreciate that more than another round of applause."] = "male\\lore7944_befriended_1.ogg",
            ["You take care with things other people might overlook. I am very glad to have you here."] = "male\\lore7950_befriended_1.ogg",
            ["Why, thank you, kind {name}."] = "male\\bowBack_1.ogg",
