            ["People will try all sorts on an adventure, then get fussy about lunch."] = "male\\lore13018_idle_1.ogg",
            ["A little cheese, a place to sit, someone to talk to. That's a good afternoon."] = "male\\lore14041_idle_1.ogg",
            ["The awkward stone is my favorite. It has brought down several towers. I keep trying it again because I want to know where it will fit. A very small problem can occupy a very pleasant afternoon."] = "male\\lore273065_idle_1.ogg",
            ["Rain against a window. That's my favorite. Yes, really. You don't have to invent a better sound than that."] = "male\\lore274917_idle_1.ogg",
            ["That old note? Useful scrap. No, you can't have it. I haven't finished finding a use for it."] = "male\\lore4081_idle_1.ogg",
            ["Cold tea again. I may have explained the principle rather more thoroughly than necessary."] = "male\\lore5174_idle_1.ogg",
            ["This wooden puzzle is clearly missing a gear. No, I haven't proved that."] = "male\\lore5175_idle_1.ogg",
            ["The bread carrier required three pages. The basket required a handle. Yes, I took the basket. I still enjoyed the three pages."] = "male\\lore5518_idle_1.ogg",
            ["I wasn't drumming. I was checking the tins. Thoroughly. In a rather catchy sequence. Yes, all right, I was drumming."] = "male\\lore5519_idle_1.ogg",
            ["The best part? When the light catches everyone's faces. You can't put that in a box."] = "male\\lore5569_idle_1.ogg",
            ["I meant to say thank you calmly. Then I saw what they'd brought me. Impossible!"] = "male\\lore6169_idle_1.ogg",
            ["A comb? Certainly. One must be prepared for a scientific breakthrough."] = "male\\lore6569_idle_1.ogg",
