            ["Ready? Me too."] = "nightelf-female\\npc_back_5.ogg",
            ["Your bags are bursting. Time to sell a few things."] = "nightelf-female\\npc_bagsFull_1.ogg",
            ["No room left? I know a merchant or two."] = "nightelf-female\\npc_bagsFull_2.ogg",
            ["You're carrying half the countryside."] = "nightelf-female\\npc_bagsFull_3.ogg",
            ["Your pack's going to split at the seams."] = "nightelf-female\\npc_bagsFull_4.ogg",
            ["I would welcome your company, my friend. Lead on. We have time to look around us, and I should like to hear what you find pleasing along the way."] = "nightelf-female\\lore270581_befriended_1.ogg",
            ["I would be glad to walk with you. You have given me reason to trust your company, and it is pleasant to speak without making every moment a lesson. Tell me what you have enjoyed today. We can leave the drills for another time."] = "nightelf-female\\lore3593_befriended_1.ogg",
            ["I would welcome the chance to accompany you. There is much to notice beyond the questions brought to my door, and I have come to value how you see things. Tell me what is on your mind. We need not make every conversation an instruction."] = "nightelf-female\\lore3595_befriended_1.ogg",
            ["Someone who remembers there is more to me than the next lesson. I am glad you came. Let us enjoy the road together."] = "nightelf-female\\lore5499_befriended_1.ogg",
            ["A friend to share the discoveries with. I am glad. Come along. You may notice something I would have walked past."] = "nightelf-female\\lore5503_befriended_1.ogg",
            ["You listen, and you ask something worth answering. I find myself looking forward to your visits. Come along, my friend."] = "nightelf-female\\lore5566_befriended_1.ogg",
            ["I would be glad to come along. Your company has become something I look forward to, and it is pleasant to share a little more of the day. Tell me where we are going. I may have something for us to eat when we pause."] = "nightelf-female\\lore8583_befriended_1.ogg",
            ["Likewise."] = "nightelf-female\\npc_bowBack_1.ogg",
            ["An honor."] = "nightelf-female\\npc_bowBack_2.ogg",
            ["The pleasure's mine."] = "nightelf-female\\npc_bowBack_3.ogg",
