            ["Do adventurers ever take a day off? Asking for a friend. The friend is me."] = "skyborne-female\\npc_idle_28.ogg",
            ["I've counted twelve birds since we set out. Thirteen. Never mind."] = "skyborne-female\\npc_idle_29.ogg",
            ["One of these days you'll have to tell me how you got started."] = "skyborne-female\\npc_idle_30.ogg",
