            ["Get out of there!"] = "skyborne-male\\npc_lowHealth_5.ogg",
            ["Drink something! Anything!"] = "skyborne-male\\npc_lowHealth_6.ogg",
            ["This isn't worth dying over!"] = "skyborne-male\\npc_lowHealth_7.ogg",
            ["Run! I'll tell everyone you were brave!"] = "skyborne-male\\npc_lowHealth_8.ogg",
            ["Bandage! Potion! Something!"] = "skyborne-male\\npc_lowHealth_9.ogg",
            ["Hang on! Don't you dare go down!"] = "skyborne-male\\npc_lowHealth_10.ogg",
            ["Looks like you've got mail."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_mail_1.ogg",
            ["Someone's written to you. How nice."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_mail_2.ogg",
            ["A letter! I hope it's good news."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_mail_3.ogg",
            ["Mail for you. Somebody's thinking of you."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_mail_4.ogg",
            ["Level {level}! There's nothing left to teach you, is there?"] = "skyborne-male\\npc_maxLevel_1.ogg",
            ["The very top! I'm honored to have come along for it."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_maxLevel_2.ogg",
            ["That's the peak. Where do you go from here? Anywhere you like, I suppose."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_maxLevel_3.ogg",
            ["Riding in style, I see."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_mount_1.ogg",
            ["Fine animal you've got there."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_mount_2.ogg",
            ["I'll just walk alongside, shall I?"] = "skyborne-male\\npc_mount_3.ogg",
            ["Now that's a proper way to travel."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_mount_4.ogg",
            ["Does it have a name? It looks like it should have a name."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_mount_5.ogg",
            ["{friend} seems friendly."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_newFriend_1.ogg",
            ["I've heard good things about {friend}."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_newFriend_2.ogg",
            ["Another friend! You collect them like coins."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_newFriend_3.ogg",
            ["Another friendly face. You're good at this."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_newFriend_4.ogg",
            ["You make friends faster than I make tea."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_newFriend_5.ogg",
            ["What is it? I don't see anything."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_pointToo_1.ogg",
            ["Where? Oh! No, I still don't see it."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_pointToo_2.ogg",
            ["Is it something good? Or something bad?"] = "skyborne-male\\npc_pointToo_3.ogg",
            ["Yes, {name}?"] = "skyborne-male\\npc_poke_1.ogg",
            ["Hm? Something on your mind?"] = "skyborne-male\\npc_poke_2.ogg",
            ["I'm right here."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_poke_3.ogg",
            ["Careful, now."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_poke_4.ogg",
            ["Ha! You're a funny one."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_poke_5.ogg",
            ["Need something?"] = "skyborne-male\\npc_poke_6.ogg",
            ["Still here, still with you."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_poke_7.ogg",
            ["What is it? Did you see something?"] = "skyborne-male\\npc_poke_8.ogg",
            ["If that's how you say hello where you're from, all right."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_poke_9.ogg",
            ["I'm listening."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_poke_10.ogg",
            ["Still breathing, if that's what you're checking."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_poke_11.ogg",
            ["Was that a poke or a question?"] = "skyborne-male\\npc_poke_12.ogg",
            ["Easy! I bruise like a peach."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_poke_13.ogg",
            ["You have my full attention. Mostly."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_poke_14.ogg",
            ["Hm? Sorry, I was miles away."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_poke_15.ogg",
            ["Ask away."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_poke_16.ogg",
            ["Ow. Was that necessary?"] = "skyborne-male\\npc_poke_17.ogg",
            ["What, did I miss something?"] = "skyborne-male\\npc_poke_18.ogg",
            ["Present and accounted for."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_poke_19.ogg",
            ["Yes, yes, I see you."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_poke_20.ogg",
            ["All right, all right, I'm awake!"] = "skyborne-male\\npc_pokeMany_1.ogg",
            ["Is this going to keep happening?"] = "skyborne-male\\npc_pokeMany_2.ogg",
            ["You'd think I was a doorbell."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_pokeMany_3.ogg",
            ["I'm starting to think you enjoy this."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_pokeMany_4.ogg",
            ["Enough! I surrender!"] = "skyborne-male\\npc_pokeMany_5.ogg",
            ["One more and I'm going home. I mean it. Probably."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_pokeMany_6.ogg",
            ["Another job done. Nicely handled."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_quest_1.ogg",
            ["Well done! They'll be grateful."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_quest_2.ogg",
            ["You've a knack for helping folk."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_quest_3.ogg",
            ["That's one more person sleeping easier tonight."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_quest_4.ogg",
            ["Good work. Who's next?"] = "skyborne-male\\npc_quest_5.ogg",
            ["Word gets around. People will remember that."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_quest_6.ogg",
            ["Nicely done. Somebody's going to tell that story at the inn."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_quest_7.ogg",
            ["That's the way!"] = "skyborne-male\\npc_quest_8.ogg",
            ["You make it look easy."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_quest_9.ogg",
            ["Done and done. What's next?"] = "skyborne-male\\npc_quest_10.ogg",
            ["Another errand? I like your spirit."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_questAccepted_1.ogg",
            ["Off we go, then."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_questAccepted_2.ogg",
            ["Somebody's lucky you came along."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_questAccepted_3.ogg",
            ["Here we go again. I love it."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_questAccepted_4.ogg",
            ["Sounds like trouble. Count me in."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_questAccepted_5.ogg",
            ["Hm? Did I doze off?"] = "skyborne-male\\npc_reload_1.ogg",
            ["Strange. I could swear the world just blinked."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_reload_2.ogg",
            ["Where was I? Oh, right. With you."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_reload_3.ogg",
            ["Hm. I lost my train of thought. Something about the road."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_reload_4.ogg",
            ["A good place to rest our feet."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_rest_1.ogg",
            ["Nothing like a warm inn."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_rest_2.ogg",
            ["I could sit here all day."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_rest_3.ogg",
            ["A chair, a fire, good company. That's living."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_rest_4.ogg",
            ["Let's stay a moment. My feet insist."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_rest_5.ogg",
            ["Easy there, tiger."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_roarBack_1.ogg",
            ["Very fierce. I'm terrified."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_roarBack_2.ogg",
            ["Was that a roar or a yawn?"] = "skyborne-male\\npc_roarBack_3.ogg",
            ["Charming."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_rudeBack_1.ogg",
            ["I'll pretend I didn't see that."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_rudeBack_2.ogg",
            ["Well, I never! Actually, I have. But still."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_rudeBack_3.ogg",
            ["At your service."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_saluteBack_1.ogg",
            ["Sir! Or madam."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_saluteBack_2.ogg",
            ["Standing ready!"] = "skyborne-male\\npc_saluteBack_3.ogg",
            ["Oh, it's {friend}! Say hello for me."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_seeFriend_1.ogg",
            ["{friend}! Good to see a friendly face."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_seeFriend_2.ogg",
            ["Look who it is! Give them a wave."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_seeFriend_3.ogg",
            ["Oh, I know them! Small world."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_seeFriend_4.ogg",
            ["No need to be shy."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_shyToo_1.ogg",
            ["Aw, don't hide."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_shyToo_2.ogg",
            ["You're among friends here."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_shyToo_3.ogg",
            ["Don't mind if I do."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_sitToo_1.ogg",
            ["Good idea. My knees agree."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_sitToo_2.ogg",
            ["Ah, that's better."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_sitToo_3.ogg",
            ["I could use a nap myself."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_sleepToo_1.ogg",
            ["Wake me when it's time to go."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_sleepToo_2.ogg",
            ["A nap does sound nice."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_sleepToo_3.ogg",
            ["Up we go! Never gets old."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_taxi_1.ogg",
            ["Look at it all down there."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_taxi_2.ogg",
            ["A good gryphon is worth its weight in gold."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_taxi_3.ogg",
            ["Hold on tight!"] = "skyborne-male\\npc_taxi_4.ogg",
            ["I'll never get tired of this view."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_taxi_5.ogg",
            ["Don't look down. Actually, do. It's lovely."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_taxi_6.ogg",
            ["The wind up here! Hold on to your hat."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_taxi_7.ogg",
            ["Anytime."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_thanked_1.ogg",
            ["Happy to help."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_thanked_2.ogg",
            ["Don't mention it."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_thanked_3.ogg",
            ["{friend} thinks of you as {tier} now. I'm not surprised."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_tier_1.ogg",
            ["Making friends everywhere you go, aren't you?"] = "skyborne-male\\npc_tier_2.ogg",
            ["People really warm to you, don't they?"] = "skyborne-male\\npc_tier_3.ogg",
            ["That friendship's growing. Nice to see."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_tier_4.ogg",
            ["Hello!"] = "skyborne-male\\npc_waveBack_1.ogg",
            ["Hi there!"] = "skyborne-male\\npc_waveBack_2.ogg",
            ["Well, hello to you too."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_waveBack_3.ogg",
            ["Right back at you!"] = "skyborne-male\\npc_waveBack_4.ogg",
            ["So this is {zone}."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_zone_1.ogg",
            ["{zone}, eh? Lead on."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_zone_2.ogg",
            ["I haven't been to {zone} in years."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_zone_3.ogg",
            ["{zone}. Stay sharp."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_zone_4.ogg",
            ["Ah, {zone}. Look at that view."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_zone_5.ogg",
            ["New place, new faces."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_zone_6.ogg",
            ["Keep your eyes open. I don't know these parts."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_zone_7.ogg",
            ["I've only ever heard stories about this place."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_zone_8.ogg",
            ["Look at it all. Worth the walk."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_zone_9.ogg",
            ["Smells different here. Not bad, just different."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_zone_10.ogg",
            ["I'd better remember the way back."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_zone_11.ogg",
            ["Well, this is a change of scenery."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_zone_12.ogg",
        },
        ["tauren-female"] = {
            ["I would be glad to share your path for a while. Tell me what has stayed with you from the day. A lesson, a worry, or something that made you smile. Good company leaves room for all of them, and I have come to value yours."] = "tauren-female\\lore3062_befriended_1.ogg",
            ["Welcome, friend. Come and tell me what you have learned since we last spoke. There is time to listen. If you notice my foot tapping, I have a small rhythm caught in my thoughts. It may escape the moment I try to explain it."] = "tauren-female\\lore3062_greet_1.ogg",
            ["I like listening to rain on the tent. A few drops find a rhythm, and I try following it with my foot. Then the pattern changes, and I have to begin again. It is a pleasant way to discover how quickly certainty can turn into laughter."] = "tauren-female\\lore3062_idle_1.ogg",
            ["You have taken another step. Give yourself time to understand it, and bring me the questions that follow. I hope each lesson leaves you better prepared, but you need not pretend that learning is finished. We can speak again, and look at what experience has shown you."] = "tauren-female\\lore3062_learned_1.ogg",
        },
        ["tauren-male"] = {
            ["I would be glad to come along. You seem to remember there are people at the end of the road who need what we bring back. That matters to me. And if we find a good meal, I promise to divide the last spoonful fairly."] = "tauren-male\\lore2980_befriended_1.ogg",
            ["I would welcome a walk with you. There is much we can notice when we give ourselves time. Tell me where your path has taken you, and what you have found worth remembering. I am glad to share a little of the journey."] = "tauren-male\\lore2981_befriended_1.ogg",
            ["I would welcome your company. We can speak of what you have learned, or find something pleasant to notice along the path. A friend need not bring a test to every meeting. I will even spare you my worst rhyme, unless you ask to hear it."] = "tauren-male\\lore2982_befriended_1.ogg",
            ["I would enjoy walking with you. Tell me what you see, and we can compare our observations. There is always something I might have missed. And if you hear a poor attempt at a bird call, remember that everyone needs practice at something."] = "tauren-male\\lore3061_befriended_1.ogg",
            ["Welcome, friend. What has the day brought you? A useful hunt, I hope, or at least a story we can enjoy over a meal. I have been keeping an eye on the stew pot. There may yet be something worth sharing at the bottom."] = "tauren-male\\lore2980_greet_1.ogg",
            ["Welcome, my friend. Sit with me a moment. I have been working on a small carving between other duties. A leaf, nothing elaborate. There is pleasure in letting a simple shape take its time. Tell me how your own work has been going."] = "tauren-male\\lore2981_greet_1.ogg",
            ["Welcome. You have come with something on your mind. Speak, and I will listen. If you catch me pausing afterward, do not assume the answer is a mystery. I may simply be trying to stop a very poor rhyme from escaping into the conversation."] = "tauren-male\\lore2982_greet_1.ogg",
            ["Welcome. What have you noticed today? There is more to learning the plains than remembering where to aim. I have been listening to a bird near camp. It answers my whistle now and then. Whether that means I am improving is another question entirely."] = "tauren-male\\lore3061_greet_1.ogg",
            ["You can keep the grand trophy. Give me a good hide, meat for the pot, and something useful to carry home. Those are things the camp will remember when the boasting is over. Though I admit I am especially attentive when the pot is nearly empty."] = "tauren-male\\lore2980_idle_1.ogg",
            ["This little leaf came from a scrap I had set aside. I found I liked working at the curve in quiet moments. One edge is still uneven. I may leave it that way. It rests pleasantly in my hand, and that is reason enough to enjoy it."] = "tauren-male\\lore2981_idle_1.ogg",
            ["Bristleback. Whistle back. Yes, I know. There must be a better use for those words than the one I have found. You need not look so solemn. I am allowed to enjoy a foolish rhyme without declaring it part of the rites."] = "tauren-male\\lore2982_idle_1.ogg",
            ["The bird makes it sound so easy. One little call, clear as anything. Mine needs work. I think it answered that last attempt, though I cannot say whether it approved. It is useful for a teacher to remember what being a beginner feels like."] = "tauren-male\\lore3061_idle_1.ogg",
            ["A new lesson. Give it care before you measure yourself by how quickly you master it. Even a small carving asks the hand to learn. With patience, the next attempt may teach you something the first one could not."] = "tauren-male\\lore2981_learned_1.ogg",
            ["A new lesson asks something of you beyond remembering its words. Try it with care, and notice where your understanding holds. There is no shame in a question. I would rather hear one honest uncertainty than watch someone mistake a proud face for wisdom."] = "tauren-male\\lore2982_learned_1.ogg",
            ["Good. Try it carefully before deciding you have mastered it. Watch what changes when you slow down. One successful attempt is worth enjoying, and the next one is worth your full attention. That applies to a fine shot, or to a very stubborn whistle."] = "tauren-male\\lore3061_learned_1.ogg",
            ["Good work. Think of what those supplies will become. A meal, a mended shelter, clothing that keeps someone warm. It is easy to see only the hunt while you are out there. I like to remember what happens after we carry it home."] = "tauren-male\\lore2980_quest_1.ogg",
        },
        ["troll-female"] = {
            ["I would enjoy a walk with you. Keep your eyes open and tell me what catches your attention. We need not turn every observation into a lesson. A little curiosity and good company can make the journey pleasant enough by themselves."] = "troll-female\\lore5884_befriended_1.ogg",
            ["There you are. Come and sit a moment. I have found a pleasant angle for this little fan, and I am prepared to enjoy it. Tell me what you have been learning. You may find I have an opinion, especially if you tried to hurry the lesson."] = "troll-female\\lore5884_greet_1.ogg",
            ["A scrap of paper, a few folds, and a little care with the angle. That is all this fan needs. I like the moment when a small adjustment makes it work better. It pays to notice what the thing in your hand is actually doing."] = "troll-female\\lore5884_idle_1.ogg",
            ["Good. Now give yourself time to understand what you have learned. Watch what changes when you try it carefully. Confidence has its uses, but I am much more interested in the moment when you can explain why something worked."] = "troll-female\\lore5884_learned_1.ogg",
        },
        ["troll-male"] = {
            ["I would be glad to walk with you. We can speak along the way, and leave some quiet between the words. Tell me what you have noticed. A familiar path may still have something to show us when we share it with a friend."] = "troll-male\\lore3188_befriended_1.ogg",
            ["I would like your company. You need not find the right words for everything. Tell me what you can see from here, or sit quietly beside me. It helps to have a friend who sees more than the trouble I am in."] = "troll-male\\lore3287_befriended_1.ogg",
            ["Thank you. I have spent enough time imagining what people would say of me. You came close enough to ask how I was. That means more than a speech about bravery. I will hold on to that kindness when fear starts talking again."] = "troll-male\\lore3287_comforted_1.ogg",
            ["You found me. Come, sit a moment and tell me how the day has been. There is room for a difficult thought, or a small pleasant one. We need not hurry either of them away before you have finished speaking."] = "troll-male\\lore3188_greet_1.ogg",
            ["You stopped. I am glad. There is a little ant near my hand carrying something far too big for it. I have been quietly taking its side. Sit a moment, if you can. I would welcome someone taking mine as well."] = "troll-male\\lore3287_greet_1.ogg",
            ["This shell is only a shell. Smooth beneath the thumb, a pleasing shape to turn in the hand. Sometimes that is enough to help a thought settle. I listen better when I leave a little space before the answer."] = "troll-male\\lore3188_idle_1.ogg",
            ["There. It dropped the crumb again. Wait before you laugh. It is going around the other side to try a different grip. I like that. A poor beginning need not decide the whole journey. I am trying to remember it myself."] = "troll-male\\lore3287_idle_1.ogg",
            ["Here is a place to sit. Let your hands rest for a moment. You need not bring me a question every time we meet. Your company is welcome too. We can watch the light move, and speak when there is something we wish to say."] = "troll-male\\lore3188_rest_1.ogg",
        },
    },
}
